#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:1
msgid "Complete a first quantization run"
msgstr "完成第一次量化运行"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:3
msgid ""
"This tutorial walks through one complete FlagOS-Compressor path: inspect "
"a local checkpoint, verify the quantization plan with a dry-run, generate"
" a W8A16 artifact, and validate the output directory."
msgstr ""
"本教程将完整演示 FlagOS-Compressor 的一条流程：检查本地检查点，使用试运行验证量化计划，生成 W8A16 产物，并验证输出目录。"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:5
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前置条件"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:7
msgid "Before you begin, make sure you have:"
msgstr "开始前，请确保具备以下条件："

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:9
msgid "Python 3.10 or later"
msgstr "Python 3.10 或更高版本"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:10
msgid "PyTorch installed for the backend you plan to use"
msgstr "已针对计划使用的后端安装 PyTorch"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:11
msgid ""
"FlagOS-Compressor installed. See the [installation guide](../how-"
"to/install.md)"
msgstr ""
"已安装 FlagOS-Compressor。请参阅[安装指南](../how-to/install.md)"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:12
msgid "a local HuggingFace `safetensors` checkpoint directory"
msgstr "本地 HuggingFace `safetensors` 检查点目录"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:13
msgid "an empty output location with enough space for generated shards"
msgstr "具有足够空间用于生成分片的空输出位置"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:15
msgid "The input checkpoint should include at least:"
msgstr "输入检查点至少应包含："

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:25
msgid ""
"Do not write output into the source model directory. Use a new empty "
"directory for each test so old shards and old configs cannot mix with new"
" output."
msgstr ""
"不要将输出写入源模型目录。每次测试都使用新的空目录，以免旧分片和旧配置与新输出混合。"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:28
msgid "Set paths"
msgstr "设置路径"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:30
msgid "Set environment variables for the source model and output root:"
msgstr "为源模型和输出根目录设置环境变量："

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:37
msgid "Replace these paths with directories that exist in your environment."
msgstr "将这些路径替换为环境中实际存在的目录。"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:39
msgid "Inspect the source checkpoint"
msgstr "检查源检查点"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:41
msgid "Run `inspect` before conversion or quantization:"
msgstr "在转换或量化前运行 `inspect`："

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:47
msgid "Check the inspection result before continuing:"
msgstr "继续前检查结果："

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:49
msgid "recognized linear layer counts match the model structure"
msgstr "识别出的线性层数量与模型结构匹配"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:50
msgid ""
"source weight formats are recognized as BF16, FP16, FP32, MXFP4, or "
"supported block FP8"
msgstr ""
"源权重格式被识别为 BF16、FP16、FP32、MXFP4 或受支持的块 FP8"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:51
msgid "Dense models do not show routed expert counts"
msgstr "稠密模型不显示路由专家数量"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:52
msgid "MoE models show expected routed or shared expert groups"
msgstr "MoE 模型显示预期的路由专家组或共享专家组"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:54
msgid "For a structured record, save JSON output:"
msgstr "如需结构化记录，请保存 JSON 输出："

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:62
msgid "Run a dry-run"
msgstr "运行试运行"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:64
msgid "Run the same quantization command with `--dry-run` first:"
msgstr "首先为相同的量化命令添加 `--dry-run` 运行："

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:78
msgid "Review the plan before writing weights:"
msgstr "写入权重前检查计划："

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:80
msgid "selected weight counts match expectations"
msgstr "选定的权重数量符合预期"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:81
msgid "W/A bits, strategy, and group size are correct"
msgstr "W/A 位数、策略和组大小正确"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:82
msgid "no selector is reported as unmatched"
msgstr "没有选择器被报告为未匹配"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:83
msgid "no fused unit or routed expert bank is split"
msgstr "没有融合单元或路由专家权重库被拆分"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:84
msgid "`unmatched quantized` is `0` for supported source-quantized inputs"
msgstr "对于受支持的源量化输入，`unmatched quantized` 为 `0`"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:86
msgid "If CUDA is not available, use `--backend cpu` for a functional check."
msgstr "如果 CUDA 不可用，请使用 `--backend cpu` 进行功能检查。"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:88
msgid "Generate the artifact"
msgstr "生成产物"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:90
msgid "Remove `--dry-run` and run the command again:"
msgstr "移除 `--dry-run` 后再次运行命令："

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:103
msgid "During generation, monitor for:"
msgstr "生成期间，请关注："

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:105
msgid "unexpected backend fallback"
msgstr "意外的后端回退"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:106
msgid "shape or group-size errors"
msgstr "形状或组大小错误"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:107
msgid "output file creation failures"
msgstr "输出文件创建失败"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:109
msgid "Validate the output"
msgstr "验证输出"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:111
msgid "Run validation on the output directory:"
msgstr "对输出目录运行验证："

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:118
msgid "Expected result:"
msgstr "预期结果："

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:124
msgid "Save a structured validation report when you need an audit trail:"
msgstr "需要审计记录时，请保存结构化验证报告："

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:132
msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:134
msgid ""
"You now have a validated W8A16 output directory containing model config, "
"shard index, weight shards, quantization metadata, report files, and "
"tokenizer files copied from the source model."
msgstr ""
"现在你已有一个通过验证的 W8A16 输出目录，其中包含模型配置、分片索引、权重分片、量化元数据、报告文件，以及从源模型复制的分词器文件。"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:136
msgid "Next step"
msgstr "下一步"

#: ../../source/tutorial/index.md:138
msgid ""
"Use the [output validation guide](../how-to/validate-outputs.md) to "
"continue with runtime loading checks and platform-specific validation."
msgstr ""
"使用[输出验证指南](../how-to/validate-outputs.md)继续进行运行时加载检查和特定平台的验证。"
